flowchart TD
  A[CLI argv] --> B{bitty-app\nstartup}
  B -->|--safe| S[Safe mode\nno third-party plugin\nminimal built-in config]
  B -->|normal| C[Load Config\ninit.lua -> ConfigPlan]
  C --> D[Validate & Merge\nXDG layers\nsource attribution]
  D --> E{Validation?}
  E -->|rejected| F[Keep last good plan\ndiagnostics]
  E -->|live| G[Reconcile → RuntimeConfig]
  E -->|restart-required| H[Persist, report restart]
  G --> I[Init bitty-platform\nWindow + event loop\nwinit]
  I --> J[Create Instance → Window]
  J --> K[Workspace compositor\none LayoutTree]
  K --> L[bitty-runtime\nwire vt, term-state, pty, render, ui, plugin-host]
  L --> M[PTY master\nspawn shell child\nslave only]
  M --> N[VT parser → TermState → Damage → Snapshot → Renderer]
  N --> O[bitty-plugin-host\nlazy reservas\nper-plugin budgets]
  S --> I
  F --> G
  H --> I
